				"type": "markup",
				"description": "Own game documents, optimistic saves, runtime progress and checkpoint modal lifecycle. Catches read and save failures and shows them in an alert; throws nothing itself. Catalog states: default (demo, nothing saved), project (saved project), loading (read pending), error (read failed), readonly (Read-only chip, no Save) and history (a commit shown as History)."
